=== simple calls ===
PASS: simple call resolves a defined word
=== redefinition visibility ===
PASS: caller sees original target
PASS: already-parsed caller sees redefined target
=== forward references ===
PASS: body binds a name defined later in the file
=== self-recursion ===
PASS: self-recursive word runs to its base case
=== mutual recursion ===
PASS: mutual recursion: 4 is even
PASS: mutual recursion: 4 is odd
PASS: mutual recursion: 7 is even
PASS: mutual recursion: 7 is odd
=== module imports ===
PASS: imported word resolves in scope
PASS: second imported word resolves
=== qualified names ===
PASS: qualified call resolves module word
PASS: qualified call resolves second module word
PASS: qualified call resolves third module word
=== module-dependency late binding ===
PASS: module body late-binds to its dep, not the global
PASS: the same-named global is left intact
=== import-frame resolution ===
PASS: captured helper resolves through the import frame
